<main class="container-fluid py-4">
  <h2>About Me</h2>

  <!-- Background section with circular profile photo on the right -->
  <section>
    <figure class="about-photo">
      <img src="/Assets/images/about-photo.jpeg" alt="Portrait of Temesgen Teklebrhan">
    </figure>
    <h3>My Background</h3>
    <p>
      My name is Temesgen Teklebrhan, and I am a second year Networking and IT Security student at
      Ontario Tech University. I have a strong interest in technology, cybersecurity, and understanding
      how computer networks work and how to protect them from security threats.
    </p>
    <p>
      Through my studies and personal projects, I have gained experience with networking and security
      tools like Cisco Packet Tracer and Kali Linux, and I have continued developing my skills in IT security.
    </p>
    <div class="clear"></div>
