  <!-- Introduction video section -->
  <section class="video-section">
    <h3>My Introduction Video</h3>
    <p>
      Watch my short introduction to learn more about who I am, my interests, and my cybersecurity goals.
    </p>
    <video controls poster="/Assets/images/about-photo.jpeg">
      <source src="/Assets/videos/intro.mp4" type="video/mp4">
      Your browser does not support the video tag.
    </video>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Experience and Skills</h3>
    <p>
      I have experience in teamwork, customer service, technical work, construction, and leadership.
      I have also worked with tools, wiring, lighting, sound systems, and digital projection equipment.
      Through school, I am continuing to build my skills in networking, cybersecurity, HTML, CSS, and
      other information technology areas.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Certifications</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>WHMIS Safety Training</li>
      <li>Worker Health and Safety Awareness</li>
      <li>Working at Heights</li>
      <li>Standard CPR and First Aid</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Career Goals</h3>
    <p>
      My goal is to work in cybersecurity and gain experience in a government cybersecurity role.
      In the future, I would like to use my knowledge and experience to start my own cybersecurity company.
    </p>
  </section>
</main>

